{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act17d0_level_act17d0_01_end",
  "groupId": "act17d0",
  "stageId": "act17d0_01",
  "title": "外勤记录",
  "storyCode": "OD-1",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act17d0/level_act17d0_01_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "2b4e658f94b838c70c600fa28c0f6e01955df373eb504bef584f334cf0f53cfd",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "最后一只！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "其他人呢！有人受伤么?",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "我这里也没问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "通讯设备呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "安全。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "这是地洞？......奇怪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "这些怪物，看起来像是沙地兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "长成这样的沙地兽？两米多长？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "......老夫在荒地里过了大半辈子，可没有见过会挖洞的沙地兽。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......这些动物，身上都有源石结晶。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "会不会是源石污染导致的生物变异？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "这附近没有移动城市，没有工厂，没有矿山，怎么会有源石污染。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "有没有可能是天灾导致的？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "你太小看大自然了。野生动物远比我们熟悉天灾，也比我们更清楚如何回避源石污染。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "天灾能摧毁一座城市，但野生动物几乎不会受到影响——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "——这片大地的淘汰是无情的，一个物种如果做不到以自己的方式与源石共生，就不可能延续到现在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "原来如此......我能想象。就像最常见的源石虫那样，体表外壳吸收了所有源石成分，内部的软体部分却完全纯净没有污染。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "说回来，PRTS的记录里有过类似案例吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "没有，就算是哥伦比亚铸铁城的那次泄漏事故也没有出现这种情况。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "沙地兽是很胆小的生物，源石变异也不该如此剧烈地改变这一点。除非被法术影响，否则它们不会展现出攻击性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "保持警戒，不要松懈。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "......法术？术师？我只希望这趟远路不要再节外生枝。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "不用想太多，继续按照原定安排前进。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "明白。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "这是......罗德岛的紧急求援信号？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "是其他罗德岛的外勤队伍？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......谢天谢......终于有人回应了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......救......救命......请求支援......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "这里是罗德岛外勤小队，收到请回复。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "这里是......长泉......瞭望塔33......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......暴徒......正在......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......他们进来了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "冷静一点！干员，出什么事了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "信号很差，断断续续的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "......救命......救......啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "这可麻烦了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "瞭望塔33是什么意思？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "听起来像是罗德岛的安全屋代号。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "安全屋？任务报告上没说过这附近还有安全屋啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "罗德岛确实会在一些偏僻的区域安插隐蔽安全屋，用于特殊外勤任务。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "但是我们不知道瞭望塔33在哪里。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "长泉......长泉......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "这个名字，老夫有点印象，让我看看地图。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "应该是这里，沿着喇叭山向东走20公里就能看到另一个峡谷，峡谷附近确实有过一个小镇。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "当年小镇里有一口井，是这附近少数可靠的水源。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "所以就叫作长泉？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "芙兰卡",
      "text": "所以接下来要怎么办，改变计划？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "也可以连夜赶往费坤，尝试联络办事处，寻求支援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "......恐怕安全屋的那位干员坚持不了这么久。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "你们继续前往费坤，想办法寻找支援。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "我去长泉看看情况。这片地方老夫很熟悉，一个人行动也比较灵活。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "如果情况太糟糕，我会去费坤与你们会合。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "这......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "我不赞同。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "哦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "沙地里钻出来的变异生物，安全屋的求救，说它们之间有联系可能显得太过多疑，但我们必须在萨尔贡荒地里保持警惕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "黑",
      "text": "在不清楚长泉镇周围情况的前提下，巡林者老先生您一个人去就更是太冒险了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "雷蛇",
      "text": "我也建议整队一起行动，状况不对我们也可以互相照应，掩护彼此撤离。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "......嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "你们说的有道理。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巡林者",
      "text": "这次老夫还是听你们的。我这一把年纪，确实也不该像年轻时那样孤身犯险了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "这东西真是奇丑无比。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "丑陋是基于个人审美的主观感想，你应当看到这种生物的象征意义，看到它在进化中展现出的无数种可能性。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "秩序不过是我们强加给自然的虚构概念，世间万物原本就是混沌无常的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）当然，我并不期待你这样的人能明白这一点，你那愚蠢的脑袋自然理解不了生物进化的伟大之处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "说我听得懂的语言！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "当然，先生。先不论你眼中的它丑陋与否，你看起来对结果都不是很满意。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "不然，你就不会现在来找我了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "还是不够强，学者！你的怪物甚至没能让领主卫队分心！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "难道不是因为你愚蠢的雇佣兵实在是太过无能？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "这些变异的生物只是武器，如果它们懂得战术，你的雇佣兵就可以被丢到垃圾堆里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "放屁，老东西！我要把你的头拧下来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "住手！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（扶额）唉。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "听着，学者。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我支持你的研究不是为了听你在这里大放厥词，你需要为我解决实际问题。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我承认你的研究确实有过人之处。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "但是！如果你不能帮我击败我的父亲，那你和你的这些怪物才是毫无用处的废物。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我的耐心是有限的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我的耐心也是有限的，这个问题我已经给你解释了很多次，我不想再浪费时间。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你在糊弄我！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "这半年来，我已经在你的“实验”中投入了你这辈子都没见过的金额。但是我根本没有得到等价的回报！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你承诺的“残忍且可怕的军队”呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你承诺的“令人胆寒的力量”呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你就拿几个会发光的，丑陋肿胀的变种生物来敷衍我？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我要怎么才能让你明白？科研的果实需要时间来孕育。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "如果科学的进步只靠金钱就能催熟，那我早就该飞到月亮上去了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "够了，我再给你两天时间，我要看到我想要的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）智障。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "如果你再敢用我听不懂的语言讲话，我就把你丢到荒地上去，让你和你的造物玩得开心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你可以试试看。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（叹气）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "给我弄几具尸体来。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "什么东西？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "带尸体来！人的尸体，你们这种生物的尸体！谁的都行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "当然，那种感染了源石疾病的人更好。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你要做什么？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "这个混账老东西，你想侮辱死者！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "你不是想要“令人胆寒的力量”吗？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "那就不要顾忌那种屁用都没有的“伦理”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "把尸体带过来，我让你看一点有趣的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "老大，这可有悖巴耶勒王酋的大戒律啊，这老东西是要坑你。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你这是要给我弄出一支长生军来？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "我不知道长生军是什么鬼东西，但是你可以对我的科研成果再抱一些信心。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "老大，我觉得......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "闭嘴！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "老家伙，你听好了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你可能觉得自己聪明绝顶，觉得自己深谋远虑，觉得自己无所不知。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "但是别想和我耍花招，你这样的人我见识得太多了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你们这种人，只会死于自作聪明。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我对你的容忍仅仅是因为你现在还有用。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "我可以给你需要的东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "但是别让我失望，你不会愿意承担让我失望的后果。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "那我还能说什么呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "祝你好运。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "别忘了，是谁让你活下去的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "如果没有我，你的研究根本就是一团畜粪。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "要不是我，半年前你就烂在这个矿洞里了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "（萨尔贡语）混账东西。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "德鲁奇",
      "text": "你们两个留在这里继续看着他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佣兵",
      "text": "好的，头儿。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）一群智障，和你们讲话的每一秒都是对我宝贵脑细胞的谋杀。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）源石......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）这个世界上竟然还有如此伟大的存在。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）这些愚昧的本地人居然畏惧这种力量带来的进化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）但是，噢，当然，他们也应当畏惧。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）愚者畏惧未知，愚者畏惧力量，愚者畏惧进步......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "列维",
      "text": "（俄语）愚蠢啊，愚蠢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
